parameters.summary:
Name of the data stream, which must meet the following criteria:
Lowercase only;
Cannot include `\`, `/`, `*`, `?`, `"`, `<`, `>`, `|`, `,`, `#`, `:`, or a space character;
Cannot start with `-`, `_`, `+`, or `.ds-`;
Cannot be `.` or `..`;
Cannot be longer than 255 bytes. Multi-byte characters count towards this limit faster.

An Elasticsearch-style query DSL object used to filter alerts. For example:
```json {
  "filter": {
    "bool": {
      "must": [],
      "filter": [
        {
          "bool": {
            "should": [
              {
                "term": {
                  "user.name": { "value": "james" }
                }
              }
            ],
            "minimum_should_match": 1
          }
        }
      ],
      "should": [],
      "must_not": []
    }
  }
} ```
